{"seq":1,"slug":"economics-thinking","title":"经济学思维","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking","rating":{"composite":3.48,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.26,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 经济学思维 简介\n\n经济学不仅是一门研究资源配置的学科，更是一套分析世界运行规律的思维方式。对于程序员而言，掌握经济学思维能够帮助你理解市场机制、优化决策过程，并在产品设计和技术架构中做出更明智的权衡取舍。\n\n本知识库面向具有一定技术背景、希望系统学习经济学核心概念的中高级程序员。你不需要任何经济学前置知识，但具备基本的数学思维和逻辑推理能力将有助于更深入地理解模型和理论。\n\n第1章**微观经济学基础**从供给与需求出发，介绍市场均衡、弹性分析和消费者理论等核心概念，帮助你理解个体和企业如何在资源约束下做出最优选择。\n\n第2章**宏观经济学基础**将视角拉升到国家和全球层面，探讨GDP与经济增长、通货膨胀与货币政策、财政政策以及国际贸易等宏观议题，让你理解经济周期和政策变动对科技行业的影响。\n\n第3章**博弈论**引入策略性思维的数学框架，涵盖博弈论基础、纳什均衡、机制设计和不确定性决策，这些工具在算法设计、拍卖系统和平台经济中有着广泛应用。\n\n第4章**行为经济学**挑战传统经济学的\"理性人\"假设，通过认知偏差、前景理论、助推与选择架构以及行为金融等主题，揭示人类决策中的系统性偏差，这对用户体验设计和产品运营有着深刻启示。\n\n建议按照章节顺序学习。微观经济学和宏观经济学构建基础框架，博弈论提供分析工具，行为经济学则打开认知的新维度。学习过程中尝试将经济学概念与你的日常技术工作联系起来，例如用供需分析理解云计算定价，用博弈论分析开源生态中的协作与竞争。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"microeconomics","title":"微观经济学基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/microeconomics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supply-and-demand","title":"供给与需求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/microeconomics/supply-and-demand"},{"seq":2,"slug":"market-equilibrium","title":"市场均衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/microeconomics/market-equilibrium"},{"seq":3,"slug":"elasticity-analysis","title":"弹性分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/microeconomics/elasticity-analysis"},{"seq":4,"slug":"consumer-theory","title":"消费者理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/microeconomics/consumer-theory"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"macroeconomics","title":"宏观经济学基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/macroeconomics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gdp-and-growth","title":"GDP 与经济增长","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/macroeconomics/gdp-and-growth"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inflation-and-monetary-policy","title":"通货膨胀与货币政策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/macroeconomics/inflation-and-monetary-policy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fiscal-policy","title":"财政政策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/macroeconomics/fiscal-policy"},{"seq":4,"slug":"international-trade","title":"国际贸易","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/macroeconomics/international-trade"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"game-theory","title":"博弈论","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/game-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"game-theory-fundamentals","title":"博弈论基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/game-theory/game-theory-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nash-equilibrium","title":"纳什均衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/game-theory/nash-equilibrium"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mechanism-design","title":"机制设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/game-theory/mechanism-design"},{"seq":4,"slug":"decision-under-uncertainty","title":"不确定性下的决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/game-theory/decision-under-uncertainty"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"behavioral-economics","title":"行为经济学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/behavioral-economics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cognitive-biases","title":"认知偏差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/behavioral-economics/cognitive-biases"},{"seq":2,"slug":"prospect-theory","title":"前景理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/behavioral-economics/prospect-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"nudge-and-choice-architecture","title":"助推与选择架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/behavioral-economics/nudge-and-choice-architecture"},{"seq":4,"slug":"behavioral-finance","title":"行为金融学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/economics-thinking/behavioral-economics/behavioral-finance"}]}]}